## Interface: 120100
## Title: DotGrid — 范围内 debuff 占比
## Notes: Shows as a bar or grid how many mobs in melee range carry the debuff(s) you watch (up to 4 spell IDs): one segment per mob, red = hit. 12.x-legal - reads no aura data, draws only its own geometry.
## Notes-enUS: Shows as a bar or grid how many mobs in melee range carry the debuff(s) you watch (up to 4 spell IDs): one segment per mob, red = hit. 12.x-legal - reads no aura data, draws only its own geometry.
## Notes-zhCN: 近战范围内的 debuff 占比条 / 格子：段数 = 怪数，红段 = 带你所监控法术（最多 4 个）的怪。12.x 合法实现：不读取光环数据，只画自己的图形。
